OL,3,AGrand Theft Auto 6 gets UK release
OL,4,Aafter 13-year wait for gamers around
OL,5,Athe world
OL,6,
OL,7,FGrand Theft Auto 6 has been released in
OL,8,Fthe UK, ending the 13-year wait for a
OL,9,Fnew instalment of the game
OL,11,FThe game is gradually being released at
OL,12,Fmidnight across different time zones -
OL,13,Fmeaning many people across the world
OL,14,Fhave already had the chance to play
OL,16,FThe game, where players can explore a
OL,17,Ffictional US state called Leonida,
OL,18,Ffeatures the series' first playable
OL,19,Ffemale protagonist in a 3D setting
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
