OL,5,Athe world
OL,6,
OL,7,FOne player in Scotland says the game's
OL,8,Ftwo protagonists, Jason and Lucia, are
OL,9,Fgiving it "2026 Bonnie and Clyde vibes"
OL,11,FThe countdown continues for players in
OL,12,Fthe US - gamers in the country have
OL,13,Fbeen telling the BBC about their
OL,14,Fexcitement for the release
